/-!
# A030317

Write the odd numbers 2n - 1 in base 2 and juxtapose these binary expansions; read the result bit-by-bit.

The 90 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A030317

